        "raw": "Good thing there was enough Tuesdays for five topics \nhttps://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-60\n\nUpcoming Schedule:\n\n* Tuesday, November 1st: Episode #229: Writers’ Room: The thing that scared Dark Visionary\n* Tuesday, November 8th: Episode #230: Creative Process: Darkstrife and Painstake Foes\n* Tuesday, November 15th: Episode #231: Writers’ Room: A minor villain gets real scary\n* Tuesday, November 22nd: Editor’s Note #61\n* Tuesday, November 29th: Episode #232: Writers’ Room: The Mocktriarch Story\n\n\nRecording Schedule:\n\n* Friday, October 28th: Episode #229: Writers’ Room: The thing that scared Dark Visionary\n* Friday, November 4th: Episode #230: Creative Process: Darkstrife and Painstake Foes\n* Friday, November 11th: Episode #231: Writers’ Room: A minor villain gets real scary\n* Friday, November 18: Editor’s Note #61\n* Friday, November 25th: Episode #232: Writers’ Room: The Mocktriarch Story",
