        "id": 248781,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-10-18T18:18:26.896Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I remain in awe of Christopher’s ability to be dapper no matter the situation.</p>\n<p>I have definitely purchased vodka solely for the bottle before. &gt;.&gt;</p>\n<p>Be careful in Louisville, Christopher, the roads are known to shift by their own devices!</p>\n<p>No, the best knuckle tats would be KNUC-KLES.</p>\n<p>I know what video Adam’s talking about, it’s rather impressive. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Ah yes, the three improv genders: “Yes, and…”, “No, but…”, “Get goin’.”</p>\n<p>Always love an Enclave musical sting. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Reduce, Reuse and Recycle? That’s amazing! He did it! XD</p>\n<p>I just spent the last week trying to find cargo pants in my size, and finding them at all was nearly impossible! I will now blame Christopher specifically for this. :V</p>\n<p>Pete sounds a lot like me! :B</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-10-18T18:18:26.896Z",
